Standard MIB modules for the SNMP Tests page of napiconfig (names and
decoding of values). Device MIBs uploaded on the MIBs page are read first.

IETF and IANA modules: extracted as is from the RFCs and IANA registries
(the same files snmp-mibs-downloader fetches). Copyright (C) The Internet
Society / IETF Trust and the persons identified as the document authors.
Extracting a MIB module as is for separate use is permitted (RFC 3978,
section 3.3; BCP 78); modules from RFCs after 10 Nov 2008 are under the
Simplified BSD License of the IETF Trust Legal Provisions.

NET-SNMP-*, UCD-*, LM-SENSORS-MIB: from net-snmp (libsnmp-base),
BSD-style licenses, see https://github.com/net-snmp/net-snmp/blob/master/COPYING
